# DWES frontend (Vite) environment. Copy to `.env` for local overrides.
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle.

# ── Feature flags ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Panel 3D model features: Generated 3D View, Upload/Replace 3D, 3D generation and
# dimension-entry controls, 3D revision history, and side-by-side 3D verification.
#
# Unset or "false" (default) => the Projects area shows a 2D-only Drawing View.
# Existing 3D data, uploaded models, and the backend routes are NOT deleted — the
# feature is only hidden. Set to "true" to restore the full 3D GA experience.
# VITE_ENABLE_PANEL_3D=true
